That's pure semantic quibbling. The player may nominate a particular
weapon to be used as a counter to being next to a monster, indicated with
a direction key. The player may nominate a particular light source to be
used as a counter to being next to a dark room, also indicated with a
direction key. Quibble gone.

>and swords don't use up oil.

The player may also nominate ammunition to be used automatically. It is
sometimes used up.
